lly-buffered and line-buffered stdout.\n\nNote the C prints the struct's raw memory, so output is layout-dependent (e.g. `driver(1)` → `01000000030000000000000000000040`, where `bathrooms=2.0` appears as little-endian `0x4000000000000000`). This is reproduced as-is; I changed nothing in `c_src/`, and the temporary C build directory I used was removed."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":436,"cache_read_input_tokens":22486,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":436,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"96e8f8d6-16a7-478c-92b7-fa206b142fe4","uuid":"18a248d2-6fe6-46ba-8760-99061787e564","timestamp":"2026-08-28T16:08:06.636Z"}
